    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "abstract",
            "block_content": "18.2本协议未尽事宜适用国家及/或甲方注册地的法律、法规、地方性规定中的强制性规定的，以相应的法律、法规、地方性规定中的规定为准。\nIssues unspecified in this Agreement, if national laws and regulations or laws and regulation of the local place where Company is registered, or compulsory local stipulations are applicable, shall be handled according to the applicable laws,regulations or compulsory local stipulations.\n18.3乙方向甲方提供的身份证/护照号码、家庭地址/居住地址及/或户口所在地、国籍等信息如有变更，乙方应当在变更之日起5个工作日内通知甲方。乙方没有按照本条规定通知甲方的，甲方按照乙方最近一次向甲方提供的地址及相关信息发送各类文件均视为送达，因乙方信息有误造成的责任和后果由乙方承担。\nThe Employee shall inform Company within 5 working days upon the change of the Employee's ID card/passport number,family residency/personal residency /registered residency or nationality. Should the Employee fails to inform the Employee as stipulated herein, documents sent by Company to Employee according to address and related information most recently provided by the Employee shall be deemed as service accomplished and the responsibilities and consequences arising from misinformation shall be borne by the Employee.\n18.4甲方向乙方分配工号、工作邮箱、办公系统用户账号。该等邮箱和系统用户账号属甲方向乙方提供的工作条件的组成部分，仅限乙方本人为工作目的使用，不得出借给任何人。乙方确认：Company allocates the Employee ID, work email address, and office system user accounts. Such mailboxes and system user accounts are part of the working conditions and shall only be used by the Employee for work purposes and shal not be lent to any person. The Employee hereby acknowledges that:\n（a）由乙方工作邮箱地址、内部网站或办公系统用户账号发出的所有邮件、文件、信息均视为由乙方本人发出且为乙方本人真实意思表示；\nAll emails, documents and information sent from the Employee's working email address, internal website or office system user account shall be deemed to be sent by the Employee and represent the Employee's true intention;\n（b）乙方通过工作邮箱、内部网站或办公系统用户账号所留下的系统操作记录或痕迹均视为乙方本人操作且为乙方本人真实意思表示；The system operation records or traces left by the Employee through the work mailbox,internal website, oroffie system user account shall be deemed to be operated by the Employee and represent the Employee's true intention;\n（c）乙方在工作邮箱或系统用户账号中收到附有甲方规章制度或任何其他与乙方工作有关或涉及乙方利益的邮件、文件、信息，均视为甲方将该等邮件、文件、信息已有效送达给乙方本人，乙方承诺仔细阅读、及时处理相关工作事务，并严格遵守相关规章制度，且对收到的前述信息严格保密。\nThe Employee receives in the work mailbox or system user account the mails, documents and information relating to Company's rules and regulations, or any other mails, documents and information related to the Employee's work or involving the Employee's interests, it shall be deemed that Company has effectively delivered such mails,documents and information to the Employee. The Employee undertakes to carefully read and handle relevant work affairs in a timely manner, strictly abide by relevant rules and regulations,and keep the information received strictly confidential 18.5除本合同明确规定外，本合同中的“日”、“月”、“年\"均指日历日、日历月、日历年。Unless otherwise specifid,thedats,monthsand yarsinthe Agrement refrtocalndardats,calendarmonthsad calendar years.\n",
